# ScriptSchedule — environment variables reference
#
# Set these in Netlify (Site settings -> Environment variables), never in
# this file or anywhere else in the repo. No real values belong here.

# Anthropic API key, used by netlify/functions/claude.js for prescription
# label / pill / document scanning.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Supabase service-role key. ONLY used by netlify/functions/delete-account.js,
# for the one operation (deleting an auth.users row) that must bypass Row
# Level Security. Treat this like a master password for the whole database.
# Get it from: Supabase dashboard -> Project Settings -> API -> service_role
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# OneSignal app id + REST API key, used by netlify/functions/schedule-push.js
# and cancel-push.js to schedule/cancel push notifications server-side.
# (Note: a separate, public OneSignal App ID is also hardcoded client-side in
# index.html for the Web SDK's own init() call -- that one is meant to be
# public and is not a secret; this server-side REST API key is.)
ONESIGNAL_APP_ID=
ONESIGNAL_REST_API_KEY=
